00:23:39,790 --> 00:23:44,980
In the future, when we're not together
and you smell it,

279
00:23:45,010 --> 00:23:47,160
you'll know

280
00:23:47,190 --> 00:23:50,120
that I'm holding you
and always staying by your side.

281
00:24:08,600 --> 00:24:10,200
My little brother might see.

282
00:24:12,060 --> 00:24:13,120
It's fine.

283
00:24:13,930 --> 00:24:14,930
Just a quick peck.

284
00:24:15,560 --> 00:24:16,360
Are you sure?

285
00:24:16,580 --> 00:24:18,310
We can hide behind the oranges.

286
00:24:28,860 --> 00:24:30,660
I think we should just forget it.

287
00:24:31,380 --> 00:24:32,430
Forget what?

288
00:24:32,850 --> 00:24:34,180
If he sees us, he sees us.

289
00:24:34,530 --> 00:24:35,590
It doesn't matter.

290
00:24:36,950 --> 00:24:38,250
Wow.

291
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:45,400
What are you guys talking about?

292
00:24:45,760 --> 00:24:47,160
Nothing, just chatting.

293
00:24:52,330 --> 00:24:53,940
Here are the drinks.

294
00:24:56,130 --> 00:24:56,930
Here, yours.

295
00:25:02,730 --> 00:25:04,060
What did the doctor say?

296
00:25:06,860 --> 00:25:08,190
Phatsa is not pregnant.

297
00:25:09,360 --> 00:25:11,860
It's because of a lack of rest

298
00:25:12,460 --> 00:25:14,790
and accumulated stress.

299
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,930
You've got to be kidding me.

300
00:25:17,300 --> 00:25:18,290
I had already mapped out

301
00:25:18,290 --> 00:25:19,800
the kid's entire future perfectly.

302
00:25:19,800 --> 00:25:21,150
I even went online and made a list

303
00:25:21,150 --> 00:25:23,280
of welcome gifts for my little nephew.

304
00:25:23,340 --> 00:25:25,470
Stop messing around.

305
00:25:26,360 --> 00:25:27,790
Phatsa not having a serious illness

306
00:25:27,790 --> 00:25:29,320
is already a huge blessing.

307
00:25:30,060 --> 00:25:32,190
But I just really want a little nephew!

308
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:34,420
That way, the Devathitirat family

309
00:25:34,420 --> 00:25:35,550
can be lively again.

310
00:25:36,560 --> 00:25:38,960
Otherwise, it's a disgrace to True Alphas.

311
00:25:57,300 --> 00:26:00,460
Ai, Sila, why don't you guys
go order your drinks first?

312
00:26:03,130 --> 00:26:06,580
Nile, help Ai and Sila
choose their drinks.

313
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:13,290
I think

314
00:26:13,310 --> 00:26:16,230
it's actually good
that Phatsa isn't pregnant right now.

315
00:26:16,230 --> 00:26:18,180
That gives you time to prepare in advance.

316
00:26:18,180 --> 00:26:20,440
After all, a male Omega getting pregnant

317
00:26:21,760 --> 00:26:23,860
is a huge deal.

318
00:26:25,460 --> 00:26:26,470
I don't even know if Phatsa's body

319
00:26:26,470 --> 00:26:27,870
will be able to handle it.

320
00:26:28,900 --> 00:26:31,120
You don't need to worry about that.

321
00:26:31,150 --> 00:26:33,570
A Pure Omega's body

322
00:26:33,590 --> 00:26:35,990
is much stronger than an ordinary Omega's.

323
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,700
Pure Omega?

324
00:26:38,130 --> 00:26:39,380
Pure Omega...

325
00:26:39,410 --> 00:26:40,670
Is Phatsa a Pure Omega?

326
00:26:46,290 --> 00:26:47,010
Phatsa,

327
00:26:48,270 --> 00:26:49,970
are you really a Pure Omega?

328
00:27:02,790 --> 00:27:05,320
You absolutely can't tell anyone
about this.

329
00:27:06,100 --> 00:27:07,830
Consider this an order from me.

330
00:27:09,910 --> 00:27:10,710
Phatsa,

331
00:27:12,560 --> 00:27:13,560
I'm sorry.

332
00:27:21,480 --> 00:27:22,280
Nakhun,

333
00:27:24,130 --> 00:27:25,790
I don't want your dad to accept me

334
00:27:25,790 --> 00:27:27,930
just because I'm a Pure Omega,

335
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:31,430
because I'm the person
they've been looking for,

336
00:27:31,430 --> 00:27:34,290
the tool that can bear a perfect heir
for the family.

337
00:27:34,800 --> 00:27:36,130
I'm not a breeding tool.

338
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:38,460
Also,

339
00:27:39,300 --> 00:27:41,730
I want your dad to accept me for who I am.

340
00:27:46,900 --> 00:27:47,940
If Dad finds out,

341
00:27:49,130 --> 00:27:51,730
Phatsa will never
have a moment of peace again.

342
00:27:52,500 --> 00:27:54,360
He will do everything in his power

343
00:27:54,930 --> 00:27:56,100
to make Phatsa

344
00:27:57,260 --> 00:27:59,460
do nothing but give him grandchildren.

345
00:28:11,820 --> 00:28:12,870
Phatsa,

346
00:28:14,850 --> 00:28:16,910
I promise you that this matter

347
00:28:16,930 --> 00:28:19,390
will forever remain a secret between us.

348
00:28:20,860 --> 00:28:22,960
As long as you are not ready,

349
00:28:22,980 --> 00:28:25,710
I will never let my dad use you
for your bloodline.

350
00:28:27,250 --> 00:28:29,280
Never.

351
00:28:35,900 --> 00:28:36,930
I'm serious.

352
00:28:37,860 --> 00:28:40,460
You absolutely cannot tell anyone
about this.

353
00:28:43,410 --> 00:28:44,270
See you at home.

354
00:28:44,270 --> 00:28:45,070
See you later.

355
00:28:47,540 --> 00:28:49,940
Ant bites, huh? Don't forget the ointment.

356
00:29:03,970 --> 00:29:05,530
You, stop playing around.

357
00:29:05,560 --> 00:29:08,980
Learn from Nakhun
and take your work more seriously.

358
00:29:09,930 --> 00:29:12,880
Is it really okay for you

359
00:29:12,910 --> 00:29:14,840
to come to the shop for me every day?

360
00:29:15,600 --> 00:29:18,380
Oh, when it comes to work,

361
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:20,490
just let Nakhun handle it himself.

362
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:22,840
That guy...

363
00:29:24,300 --> 00:29:25,200
ever since he was born,

364
00:29:25,200 --> 00:29:27,800
it's like he's carrying the entire world
on his shoulders.

365
00:29:27,800 --> 00:29:28,600
Nakhun

366
00:29:29,400 --> 00:29:31,660
is more than capable of providing for me.

367
00:29:33,500 --> 00:29:35,560
And most importantly,

368
00:29:35,590 --> 00:29:39,560
my own savings
are enough to support you for a lifetime.

369
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:43,760
Easily. You won't be starved.

370
00:29:46,280 --> 00:29:52,060
I'm not worried. I just find it strange.

371
00:29:52,930 --> 00:29:54,990
You don't seem troubled by the fact
that you're a True Alpha,

372
00:29:54,990 --> 00:29:56,780
nor do you seem to take pride in it

373
00:29:56,780 --> 00:29:58,530
like the others do.

374
00:29:58,660 --> 00:30:01,120
But the people in your family

375
00:30:01,150 --> 00:30:04,080
do everything in their power
to protect this status.

376
00:30:05,100 --> 00:30:06,330
Yet you ended up falling for

377
00:30:06,330 --> 00:30:07,730
an ordinary Beta like me.

378
00:30:17,960 --> 00:30:19,260
To me, Ongsa,

379
00:30:20,600 --> 00:30:22,630
whether it's an Alpha,

380
00:30:22,660 --> 00:30:25,860
a Beta, or an Omega,

381
00:30:26,800 --> 00:30:31,000
in the end, when the masks come off,
we are all just ordinary people.

382
00:30:32,110 --> 00:30:35,680
We all bleed red.

383
00:30:37,160 --> 00:30:39,010
We all feel pain, and we all cry.

384
00:30:40,280 --> 00:30:42,060
Your way of thinking

385
00:30:42,080 --> 00:30:43,970
really doesn't seem like someone

386
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:45,980
who grew up in the Devathitirat family.

387
00:30:45,980 --> 00:30:48,400
Maybe because I have a very good friend.

388
00:30:48,420 --> 00:30:50,840
She is a Beta, just like you.

389
00:30:51,860 --> 00:30:54,730
She is the toughest Beta I have ever met.

390
00:30:55,910 --> 00:30:59,550
Would you believe it?
That woman is a Beta,

391
00:30:59,580 --> 00:31:01,580
but she once managed to beat me,
a True Alpha,

392
00:31:01,580 --> 00:31:02,800
to the ground.

393
00:31:03,210 --> 00:31:04,010
Really?

394
00:31:05,000 --> 00:31:06,380
A Beta could actually

395
00:31:06,410 --> 00:31:08,800
beat you, a True Alpha, to the ground?

396
00:31:08,830 --> 00:31:11,300
That's right. We used to fight intensely.

397
00:31:13,370 --> 00:31:15,760
Her mother was once one of the candidates

398
00:31:15,780 --> 00:31:18,620
my family selected for my dad.

399
00:31:18,650 --> 00:31:20,910
But in the end, she wasn't chosen.

400
00:31:22,130 --> 00:31:23,330
This incident always made me
feel deeply uncomfortable

401
00:31:23,330 --> 00:31:24,990
about these so-called rules.

402
00:31:26,000 --> 00:31:27,930
Later, we went to school together.

403
00:31:28,660 --> 00:31:30,680
I saw with my own eyes that she never

404
00:31:30,710 --> 00:31:32,710
used her secondary sex as an excuse.

405
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:35,270
This gradually made me understand

406
00:31:35,270 --> 00:31:38,460
that a person's value is not

407
00:31:38,480 --> 00:31:42,960
determined by the scent of the pheromones
or the purity of their bloodline.

408
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:45,930
Instead, it depends on this heart.

409
00:31:54,530 --> 00:31:55,480
Just like what I see

410
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,600
in you, Ongsa.

411
00:32:14,360 --> 00:32:16,730
Sir, this is the update on the Pure Omega.

412
00:32:24,980 --> 00:32:26,300
Is this all of it?

413
00:32:26,390 --> 00:32:28,370
Ever since that person
went to the hospital for a blood test,

414
00:32:28,370 --> 00:32:32,090
all the medical records,
including the security footage,

415
00:32:32,480 --> 00:32:35,410
have been wiped
from the hospital's system, sir.

416
00:32:35,540 --> 00:32:36,520
Damn it!

417
00:32:36,790 --> 00:32:39,360
This means someone has known
about this for a while.

418
00:32:39,360 --> 00:32:42,000
And that person also
wants to get the child.

419
00:32:44,100 --> 00:32:48,090
Great. The more I know someone
is fighting me for him,

420
00:32:48,120 --> 00:32:49,670
the more I want him.

421
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,970
No matter what it takes,

422
00:32:52,000 --> 00:32:53,400
I must beat everyone else

423
00:32:53,410 --> 00:32:54,940
and secure that Pure Omega.

424
00:32:55,420 --> 00:32:56,380
Yes, sir.

425
00:33:02,130 --> 00:33:03,730
Dad, why did you call me here?

426
00:33:15,730 --> 00:33:17,930
I am about to acquire a Pure Omega.

427
00:33:18,640 --> 00:33:21,540
And you must form a bond with that Omega.

428
00:33:21,800 --> 00:33:23,200
Our family must have an heir

429
00:33:23,200 --> 00:33:26,090
who has the potential
to evolve into an Enigma.

430
00:33:26,960 --> 00:33:28,090
I'm not interested.

431
00:33:29,110 --> 00:33:30,280
What did you say?

432
00:33:31,700 --> 00:33:33,160
I said I'm not interested.

433
00:33:34,860 --> 00:33:36,790
I already have someone I love, Dad.

434
00:33:37,430 --> 00:33:38,440
Love?

435
00:33:39,550 --> 00:33:40,500
That is nothing but a childish fairy tale

436
00:33:40,500 --> 00:33:42,160
that only naive kids believe in.

437
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:43,500
An Alpha lowering his status

438
00:33:43,500 --> 00:33:44,500
to date a Beta

439
00:33:44,910 --> 00:33:47,850
does absolutely nothing
for our bloodline or our future.

440
00:33:47,850 --> 00:33:50,480
It will only bring disgrace
to this family.

441
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:55,330
Therefore, you must break up with Ongsa,

442
00:33:55,570 --> 00:33:59,230
and fulfill the destiny you were born for.

443
00:34:00,100 --> 00:34:02,300
If love is just a foolish fantasy,

444
00:34:02,660 --> 00:34:05,880
and dating a Beta
only produces half-breeds

445
00:34:05,900 --> 00:34:07,730
that shame our family,

446
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,860
then you wouldn't have Naphitch,

447
00:34:10,929 --> 00:34:13,790
the son who has always been a thorn
in mother's side.

448
00:34:15,150 --> 00:34:16,449
Enough, Dad!

449
00:34:22,500 --> 00:34:24,100
Mind your own business.

450
00:34:24,469 --> 00:34:26,870
This is not something
you should meddle in.

451
00:34:28,699 --> 00:34:29,900
Then who exactly am I?

452
00:34:31,850 --> 00:34:34,070
What do I even mean to this family?

453
00:34:35,760 --> 00:34:39,739
I'm just the byproduct of your lust.

454
00:34:41,170 --> 00:34:43,310
Just a substitute for that Beta,

455
00:34:44,159 --> 00:34:45,690
the person you truly loved.

456
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:48,400
Yet I don't even qualify
to be chosen by you,

457
00:34:49,290 --> 00:34:50,090
because I'm

458
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:53,500
just a half-breed Alpha, right?

459
00:34:55,699 --> 00:34:57,660
Not a True Alpha like my brothers.

460
00:35:00,330 --> 00:35:01,930
But I raised you.

461
00:35:03,250 --> 00:35:04,660
I gave you money,

462
00:35:04,730 --> 00:35:06,430
gave you a place to live,

463
00:35:06,450 --> 00:35:08,580
and provided you with a life of luxury.

464
00:35:08,590 --> 00:35:12,450
I didn't give you all that just for you
to stand here and talk back to me.

465
00:35:13,560 --> 00:35:15,620
This family's so-called importance

466
00:35:17,600 --> 00:35:19,860
is just about who can find a suitable mate

467
00:35:20,700 --> 00:35:22,760
to produce offspring for the family.

468
00:35:23,160 --> 00:35:25,290
To continue this bullshit bloodline!

469
00:35:27,100 --> 00:35:28,160
This family

470
00:35:29,080 --> 00:35:31,010
doesn't need me at all.

471
00:35:32,560 --> 00:35:33,400
Naphitch!

472
00:35:36,200 --> 00:35:37,310
Dad, you really...

473
00:36:29,680 --> 00:36:33,970
♪ All the suffering
only brings me closer ♪

474
00:36:33,970 --> 00:36:38,960
♪ Only brings me closer to you ♪

475
00:36:39,660 --> 00:36:44,140
♪ All the suffering
only brings me closer ♪

476
00:36:44,160 --> 00:36:48,840
♪ Only brings me closer to you ♪

477
00:37:00,500 --> 00:37:02,430
Hey, why are you sitting like this?

478
00:37:05,330 --> 00:37:06,850
Do you know whose son I am?

479
00:37:16,020 --> 00:37:17,320
Even if you knew,

480
00:37:19,620 --> 00:37:21,420
nobody would even care about me.

481
00:37:23,710 --> 00:37:25,170
Not even my dad

482
00:37:26,860 --> 00:37:28,220
cares about me.

483
00:37:33,260 --> 00:37:34,460
Damn it!

484
00:37:50,590 --> 00:37:51,550
Nakhun, tell me,

485
00:37:53,800 --> 00:37:55,600
has Dad ever truly loved anyone?

486
00:37:58,130 --> 00:37:59,460
The only person he loved

487
00:38:02,360 --> 00:38:04,220
was probably Naphitch's mother.

488
00:38:06,730 --> 00:38:08,130
Then what did I say wrong?

489
00:38:10,300 --> 00:38:11,280
Why can't I

490
00:38:11,310 --> 00:38:12,710
be with the person I love?

491
00:38:14,060 --> 00:38:15,160
Even Naphitch's mother

492
00:38:15,160 --> 00:38:16,130
was a Beta.

493
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:19,550
Because he still wants

494
00:38:19,550 --> 00:38:22,300
to keep the Devathitirat family
at the very top forever.

495
00:38:22,300 --> 00:38:24,130
If you mate with a Pure Omega,

496
00:38:25,660 --> 00:38:28,030
the next generation
of the Devathitirat family

497
00:38:28,030 --> 00:38:30,060
might produce an Enigma.

498
00:38:35,310 --> 00:38:36,360
You would never let

499
00:38:36,360 --> 00:38:37,820
Phatsa and me have a child.

500
00:38:41,470 --> 00:38:43,470
That will absolutely never happen.

501
00:38:44,100 --> 00:38:45,430
That's not what I meant.

502
00:38:45,630 --> 00:38:47,490
You'd better go tell that old man.

503
00:38:48,500 --> 00:38:51,100
The only child
he truly cares about is that one.

504
00:38:51,350 --> 00:38:53,680
Who knows where that kid
has run off to now.

505
00:39:04,750 --> 00:39:05,550
Hello?

506
00:39:06,160 --> 00:39:08,270
What kind of trouble
did he cause this time?

507
00:39:08,270 --> 00:39:09,660
Human trafficking?

508
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:10,760
Naphitch?

509
00:39:12,020 --> 00:39:12,820
What?

510
00:39:13,700 --> 00:39:16,030
I think you've arrested the wrong person.

511
00:39:17,060 --> 00:39:18,140
How could we be wrong? The evidence shows

512
00:39:18,140 --> 00:39:20,870
that you were the last person
seen with her.

513
00:39:23,730 --> 00:39:26,820
Impossible. I don't even know who she is.

514
00:39:26,850 --> 00:39:28,260
How could I have been with her?

515
00:39:28,260 --> 00:39:29,310
I don't believe

516
00:39:29,330 --> 00:39:32,030
that my brother
would be involved in human trafficking.

517
00:39:32,030 --> 00:39:34,190
I understand how you feel.

518
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:37,130
But right now,
all the evidence points to him.

519
00:39:37,130 --> 00:39:38,230
What evidence?

520
00:39:38,860 --> 00:39:43,540
We have witness testimonies
and the victim's identification.

521
00:39:44,100 --> 00:39:47,500
My brother has nothing to do with this.
You have to believe me.

522
00:39:49,890 --> 00:39:52,560
This isn't something that can be resolved
just by believing.

523
00:39:52,560 --> 00:39:55,330
Everything must be handled
according to the case facts and evidence.

524
00:39:55,330 --> 00:39:56,930
Then can I talk to my brother?

525
00:40:03,700 --> 00:40:05,400
Nakhun! Nakhin!

526
00:40:07,730 --> 00:40:08,730
Help me!

527
00:40:11,700 --> 00:40:12,660
Answer me first.

528
00:40:13,650 --> 00:40:14,980
The human trafficking,

529
00:40:16,060 --> 00:40:17,160
did you do it?

530
00:40:19,130 --> 00:40:20,000
It wasn't me.

531
00:40:21,460 --> 00:40:22,960
I didn't do anything.

532
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:26,500
They're framing me.

533
00:40:35,760 --> 00:40:36,820
Look me in the eyes,

534
00:40:38,200 --> 00:40:39,330
and answer me again.

535
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:44,900
It wasn't me.

536
00:40:50,300 --> 00:40:51,730
It really wasn't me.

537
00:40:53,930 --> 00:40:55,190
You have to believe me.

538
00:40:58,060 --> 00:40:58,860
Listen to me.

539
00:40:59,760 --> 00:41:02,220
I will get you out of here
as soon as possible.

540
00:41:08,130 --> 00:41:09,110
I'm here to post bail

541
00:41:09,110 --> 00:41:09,930
for Mr. Naphitch.

542
00:41:09,930 --> 00:41:12,790
Here are the relevant documents
and the bail money.

543
00:41:13,460 --> 00:41:15,690
This is not an ordinary case.

544
00:41:15,720 --> 00:41:18,160
It's a human trafficking case.

545
00:41:18,190 --> 00:41:20,560
It requires a signature
and approval from a superior.

546
00:41:20,560 --> 00:41:22,000
However, according to procedure,

547
00:41:22,000 --> 00:41:24,530
we can submit
the bail application right now.

548
00:41:24,880 --> 00:41:26,630
You can certainly apply,

549
00:41:27,200 --> 00:41:29,850
but we don't know when it gets approved.

550
00:41:30,400 --> 00:41:32,000
You are stalling on purpose.

551
00:41:32,040 --> 00:41:33,700
I'm just following the rules.

552
00:41:33,980 --> 00:41:36,360
Is it a rule, or someone's order?

553
00:41:37,180 --> 00:41:38,870
Please watch your mouth.

554
00:41:43,260 --> 00:41:43,920
Mr. Nakhun,

555
00:41:43,930 --> 00:41:45,590
Mr. Nakhin, please calm down.

556
00:41:58,580 --> 00:41:59,140
Help me.

557
00:42:05,770 --> 00:42:08,210
The bail money is on the table.

558
00:42:08,240 --> 00:42:10,950
My brother must go home with me
right now.

559
00:42:10,980 --> 00:42:12,910
I will compensate for any damages.

560
00:42:12,930 --> 00:42:15,260
If there are any issues,
talk to my lawyer.

561
00:42:15,930 --> 00:42:17,790
Or do you have a problem with that?

562
00:42:20,600 --> 00:42:21,400
Dad,

563
00:42:24,400 --> 00:42:25,930
I really didn't do it.

564
00:42:28,160 --> 00:42:29,800
Whether you did it or not,

565
00:42:30,400 --> 00:42:32,930
the news has already reported your arrest.

566
00:42:33,970 --> 00:42:35,430
As a son,

567
00:42:36,160 --> 00:42:38,750
why are you always
causing trouble for the family?

568
00:42:38,750 --> 00:42:39,350
Dad!

569
00:42:39,380 --> 00:42:40,620
Enough!

570
00:42:41,100 --> 00:42:42,860
No one should speak up for him.

571
00:42:43,570 --> 00:42:44,940
I warned you, didn't I?

572
00:42:44,980 --> 00:42:47,710
You are not allowed
to bring shame to this family.

573
00:42:48,460 --> 00:42:50,540
A low-tier Alpha like you...

574
00:42:53,060 --> 00:42:54,200
Enough, Dad!

575
00:42:54,860 --> 00:42:57,320
What, are you going
to stand up for him again?

576
00:42:57,960 --> 00:42:59,690
If Naphitch is truly innocent,

577
00:42:59,910 --> 00:43:01,520
I will protect him

578
00:43:01,540 --> 00:43:03,670
together with everyone in the family.

579
00:43:04,530 --> 00:43:06,430
No matter how others view him,

580
00:43:06,700 --> 00:43:08,460
if he didn't do it,

581
00:43:08,480 --> 00:43:11,810
he shouldn't be pushed out
to take the fall for someone else.

582
00:43:24,020 --> 00:43:25,510
And you.

583
00:43:26,400 --> 00:43:28,460
Ever since you moved into this house,

584
00:43:28,490 --> 00:43:30,520
the disasters have never stopped.

585
00:43:31,130 --> 00:43:32,530
You are an absolute jinx.

586
00:43:47,130 --> 00:43:49,920
If your company is in trouble,

587
00:43:49,940 --> 00:43:53,860
what you should do is
find a way to fix it,

588
00:43:54,270 --> 00:43:56,860
instead of coming here
to hurl insults at your own family.

589
00:43:56,860 --> 00:43:58,210
Because doing this

590
00:43:59,600 --> 00:44:01,900
won't make you look more authoritative.

591
00:44:02,420 --> 00:44:05,620
It will only show everyone
that you're scared.

592
00:44:07,130 --> 00:44:10,060
Scared because you don't know
how to fix the problem,

593
00:44:10,160 --> 00:44:11,310
so you vent your anger

594
00:44:11,310 --> 00:44:13,110
on those weaker than you, right?

595
00:44:13,260 --> 00:44:14,130
Mr. Naret.

596
00:44:37,020 --> 00:44:39,600
Hello, what would you like to drink today?

597
00:44:39,730 --> 00:44:41,460
Huh? Are you alone today, Nile?

598
00:44:41,640 --> 00:44:42,440
Yes.

599
00:44:43,360 --> 00:44:44,800
Then what about Ongsa?

600
00:44:46,050 --> 00:44:47,390
Ongsa...

601
00:44:50,660 --> 00:44:52,590
Who knows who he went on a date with.

602
00:44:53,070 --> 00:44:53,890
Yeah.

603
00:44:53,910 --> 00:44:54,590
Na...

604
00:44:55,530 --> 00:44:56,150
Nakhin!

605
00:44:56,180 --> 00:44:57,280
Wow.

606
00:44:58,860 --> 00:45:00,440
Do you have any orders today?

607
00:45:00,440 --> 00:45:03,940
Today? We have orders all the time.
What do you want to drink?

608
00:45:04,710 --> 00:45:07,100
Um, hot chocolate maybe?

609
00:45:07,120 --> 00:45:07,800
Sold out.

610
00:45:08,060 --> 00:45:08,960
Matcha latte?

611
00:45:08,980 --> 00:45:09,700
Sold out.

612
00:45:09,730 --> 00:45:10,550
Thai iced milk tea?

613
00:45:10,550 --> 00:45:11,450
Sold out.

614
00:45:11,580 --> 00:45:13,620
Then what exactly is left in your shop?

615
00:45:13,620 --> 00:45:15,010
Just kidding.

616
00:45:16,030 --> 00:45:18,290
I'll make all three for you, okay?

617
00:45:18,400 --> 00:45:19,610
One is enough.

618
00:45:20,260 --> 00:45:21,780
Otherwise, I won't be able
to sleep tonight.

619
00:45:21,780 --> 00:45:22,580
Three cups.

620
00:45:28,400 --> 00:45:29,460
Have a drink first.

621
00:45:30,400 --> 00:45:33,260
That way you'll have the energy
to think things through.

622
00:45:33,260 --> 00:45:34,060
Thank you.

623
00:45:37,730 --> 00:45:41,330
This is the preliminary case information
we've compiled so far.

624
00:45:43,730 --> 00:45:46,720
I paid the police
for some extra documents,

625
00:45:46,750 --> 00:45:48,550
so this is all we can find for now.

626
00:45:48,780 --> 00:45:49,960
Inside here,

627
00:45:49,980 --> 00:45:52,630
there's also a photo of that woman
named Mai.

628
00:46:17,280 --> 00:46:18,140
This person...

629
00:46:22,210 --> 00:46:23,340
Do you remember her?

630
00:46:23,730 --> 00:46:25,200
I'm not entirely sure,

631
00:46:25,220 --> 00:46:28,200
but I think I saw her
at the bar that night.

632
00:46:45,070 --> 00:46:50,260
Have another drink with me,
so we can get acquainted.

633
00:46:45,220 --> 00:46:49,090
[In the next episode]

634
00:46:51,200 --> 00:46:53,400
Since you managed to find this place,

635
00:46:53,430 --> 00:46:55,450
you must already know quite a bit.

636
00:46:55,510 --> 00:46:57,460
I know this is definitely
not a coincidence.

637
00:46:57,460 --> 00:46:58,810
And your people are also involved in it.

638
00:46:58,810 --> 00:47:00,380
That child, the Pure Omega,

639
00:47:00,400 --> 00:47:02,640
must become a member of our family.

640
00:47:02,870 --> 00:47:03,870
I won't marry him.

641
00:47:03,870 --> 00:47:05,360
You have no right to refuse.

642
00:47:05,360 --> 00:47:06,660
Then I'll do it, can I?

643
00:47:06,680 --> 00:47:07,470
You?

644
00:47:07,500 --> 00:47:09,090
It's all broken.

645
00:47:25,380 --> 00:47:29,300
♪ I linger in those beautiful memories ♪

646
00:47:29,320 --> 00:47:32,660
♪ I used to think we were meant to be ♪

647
00:47:32,980 --> 00:47:34,600
♪ But I also know ♪

648
00:47:34,630 --> 00:47:38,520
♪ That reality isn't like that ♪

649
00:47:38,640 --> 00:47:42,940
♪ I tried so hard to keep you
from leaving ♪

650
00:47:42,960 --> 00:47:46,390
♪ But this broken love
